                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice remaster of a game from my childhood and it holds true to the original(at least from what i can remember from 30 years ago).  Much easier than i remember from when it was on the NES system.  No complaints at all, but its more of a nostalgia game than anything else.  Its a very short play so don't expect alot from it, can 100% it in about 10 hours if you are decent at platforming.  I only recommend buying when you can catch it on sale.\n\nI am so glad it had extreme mode, because that is how the old NES was, when you died hat to restart from the beginning.  Love it.",
